 "name": "PWSW Protection Zones",
 "type": "Feature Layer",
 "description": "Source Water Program.  Protection zones for public water supply wells are based on times of travel calculations (i.e., how far -distance in feet- a particle of water would travel within a specified time frame).  Zone 1 is a one year time of travel.  Zone 2 is a five year time of travel and Zone 3 is a ten year time of travel.  Time of travel is based on hydrogeologic characteristics of the aquifer and pumping capacity of the well.",
